{
  "_readme": [
    "NIFTY 100 universe snapshot for the JF-OU engine.",
    "",
    "THIS IS NOT POINT-IN-TIME DATA.",
    "Upstox exposes no endpoint that answers 'which names were in the NIFTY 100 on",
    "2021-03-15', so any backtest run on this list is survivorship-biased (spec Part 2.1,",
    "Part XXIII 23.3 item 3). Refresh it periodically and keep old rows with",
    "is_current = 0 rather than overwriting them.",
    "",
    "NO ISINs ARE STORED HERE ON PURPOSE.",
    "symbol -> instrument_key is resolved at runtime from the Upstox instrument master",
    "and cached in the instruments table. Hard-coding ISINs would let a stale or",
    "invented key reach the order book.",
    "",
    "PROVENANCE, per entry, in the 'src' field:",
    "  nifty50_2026-04  symbol published explicitly alongside the company name",
    "                   (indiamacroindicators NIFTY 50 list, April 2026). NIFTY 50 is a",
    "                   subset of NIFTY 100, so these are index members.",
    "  mapped_2026-06   company name taken from the NIFTY 100 weightage list",
    "                   (smart-investing.in, 08-Jun-2026); the trading symbol was mapped",
    "                   from the company name, NOT published next to it. Treat as",
    "                   UNVERIFIED until the loader resolves it.",
    "",
    "VERIFICATION STATUS AT BUILD TIME.",
    "archives.nseindia.com and www.nseindia.com both returned HTTP 403 from the build",
    "environment, and the Upstox instrument master also 403s, so this list could NOT be",
    "validated end to end. `main.py --load-universe` resolves every symbol against the",
    "live instrument master and prints an explicit table of anything that fails to",
    "resolve. Run it before trusting a live scan.",
    "",
    "97 entries. The published NIFTY 100 weightage list at the snapshot date named a few",
    "entities whose current NSE trading symbol could not be established with confidence",
    "('TATA CAPITAL', 'LTM LTD', 'JINDAL STEEL & POWER'); they are included with",
    "src=mapped_2026-06 and must be confirmed by the resolver before use.",
    "",
    "SECTOR is a free-text tag used only by the Part XIV concentration caps and the",
    "Part 4.3 macro overlay. Upstox does not serve a sector classification, so these",
    "tags are approximate. Where a tag is missing the sector cap fails closed."
  ],
